(7473665, 1187129, 101256, '<td valign="top">That''s a rather interesting image - the whole idea of just taking an image without a viewfinder is well demonstrated with this capture.  Love it.</td>', 'That''s a rather interesting image - the whole idea of just taking an image without a viewfinder is well demonstrated with this capture.  Love it.', '2016-09-11 17:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473666, 1187109, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellent - light and shadow, wonderful detail - a very worthy challenge image.</td>', 'Excellent - light and shadow, wonderful detail - a very worthy challenge image.', '2016-09-11 17:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473669, 1186853, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the title and how it matches the image - lonely end of the day - a worthy effort although there is too much "empty" space - would have worked a little better with a closer in shot, but shooting from the hip is difficult enough. Meets the challenge.,</td>', 'I like the title and how it matches the image - lonely end of the day - a worthy effort although there is too much "empty" space - would have worked a little better with a closer in shot, but shooting from the hip is difficult enough. Meets the challenge.,', '2016-09-11 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473673, 1187173, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting - rather avant guarde - you see what you want to see, interpret the image in your own mind - pretty cool. Vague, ambiguous, but intriguing. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting - rather avant guarde - you see what you want to see, interpret the image in your own mind - pretty cool. Vague, ambiguous, but intriguing. Well done.', '2016-09-11 17:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473674, 1187034, 101256, '<td valign="top">Like it - very candid image taken on the fly.</td>', 'Like it - very candid image taken on the fly.', '2016-09-11 17:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473676, 1187196, 101256, '<td valign="top">Have to give this a ten because it is just so perfect. The slight angle, the colors vs the rather flat color of the room, the thunder mug, wood stove - a total capitulation on my part and a tip of the hat to the entrant.</td>', 'Have to give this a ten because it is just so perfect. The slight angle, the colors vs the rather flat color of the room, the thunder mug, wood stove - a total capitulation on my part and a tip of the hat to the entrant.', '2016-09-11 17:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473678, 1187139, 101256, '<td valign="top">It certainly is different that''s for sure. Meets the challenge very well. Like the out-of-focus idea - nice.</td>', 'It certainly is different that''s for sure. Meets the challenge very well. Like the out-of-focus idea - nice.', '2016-09-11 17:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473679, 1187195, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little darker than necessary - more contrast would have made this a better image. Still, it shows what can happen when shooting from the hip. Nice.</td>', 'A little darker than necessary - more contrast would have made this a better image. Still, it shows what can happen when shooting from the hip. Nice.', '2016-09-11 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473680, 1186740, 101256, '<td valign="top">I hate giving out fives, but I do if I can''t say anything positive - just seems very pedestrian - there are somethings in the image that are relatively interesting, but overall - meh. Sorry.</td>', 'I hate giving out fives, but I do if I can''t say anything positive - just seems very pedestrian - there are somethings in the image that are relatively interesting, but overall - meh. Sorry.', '2016-09-11 18:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473682, 1187193, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very good - good balance in tones, composition (accident from the hip or not) is really good - nice way to conceive what would happen without a view finder.  This should place well into the top five if not a winner.</td>', 'Very good - good balance in tones, composition (accident from the hip or not) is really good - nice way to conceive what would happen without a view finder.  This should place well into the top five if not a winner.', '2016-09-11 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473684, 1187178, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''d like to give this a higher ratings, but there isn''t a lot here to interest the viewer. A little lighter or brighter image would have helped a lot.</td>', 'I''d like to give this a higher ratings, but there isn''t a lot here to interest the viewer. A little lighter or brighter image would have helped a lot.', '2016-09-11 18:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473686, 1187156, 101256, '<td valign="top">Absolutely, flat out 10 - what a wonderful image and B&amp;W conversion. Top five for sure.</td>', 'Absolutely, flat out 10 - what a wonderful image and B&W conversion. Top five for sure.', '2016-09-11 18:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473687, 1187149, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really don''t know what to day about this - it''s nice, good color, fairly well detailed, but what''s with the angle?</td>', 'I really don''t know what to day about this - it''s nice, good color, fairly well detailed, but what''s with the angle?', '2016-09-11 18:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473689, 1187110, 101256, '<td valign="top">Its always fun to look at images like that and take your time to look at the individuals - all sorts of smiles, frowns, grins, sad faces - intriguing. Very nicely done - really like this.  The B&amp;W conversion is well done also. Should be a top three image if I were the sole judge.</td>', 'Its always fun to look at images like that and take your time to look at the individuals - all sorts of smiles, frowns, grins, sad faces - intriguing. Very nicely done - really like this.  The B&W conversion is well done also. Should be a top three image if I were the sole judge.', '2016-09-11 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473690, 1187197, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great capture - they obviously are buds - very nice capture.</td>', 'Great capture - they obviously are buds - very nice capture.', '2016-09-11 18:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473691, 1187144, 101256, '<td valign="top">Its images like this that make me want to just give up, crawl into a hole and pull it in behind me. What a capture - sheer excellence. Superlatives just don''t do this justice.  This should be the winner - flat out, hands down. The combinations of shadow and light, straight and complex angles - Wow.</td>', 'Its images like this that make me want to just give up, crawl into a hole and pull it in behind me. What a capture - sheer excellence. Superlatives just don''t do this justice.  This should be the winner - flat out, hands down. The combinations of shadow and light, straight and complex angles - Wow.', '2016-09-11 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473692, 1186954, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting imagery. Different certainly. A worthy effort.</td>', 'Interesting imagery. Different certainly. A worthy effort.', '2016-09-11 18:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473695, 1187086, 101256, '<td valign="top">Kind of like an combination impressionist/abstract/new wave painting.  I like it.</td>', 'Kind of like an combination impressionist/abstract/new wave painting.  I like it.', '2016-09-11 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473696, 1186854, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ah - the obligatory kitty photo.</td>', 'Ah - the obligatory kitty photo.', '2016-09-11 18:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473697, 1187108, 101256, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain it, but this has me laughing so it''s worth a 9.  Nice B&amp;W conversion. Well done.</td>', 'I can''t explain it, but this has me laughing so it''s worth a 9.  Nice B&W conversion. Well done.', '2016-09-11 18:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473698, 1187157, 101256, '<td valign="top">Composed in your mind''s eye and taken from the hip, this is an excellent effort more than meeting the challenge criteria. Well done.</td>', 'Composed in your mind''s eye and taken from the hip, this is an excellent effort more than meeting the challenge criteria. Well done.', '2016-09-11 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473699, 1187130, 101256, '<td valign="top">A better than average routine photo - like the kids and their obvious joy at being outdoors.</td>', 'A better than average routine photo - like the kids and their obvious joy at being outdoors.', '2016-09-11 18:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473700, 1186629, 101256, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT LOVE IT LOVE IT LOVE IT!!!  Terrific B&amp;W conversion - if I were kind of this place, this would be the challenge winner. Terrific.</td>', 'LOVE IT LOVE IT LOVE IT LOVE IT!!!  Terrific B&W conversion - if I were kind of this place, this would be the challenge winner. Terrific.', '2016-09-11 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473704, 1187183, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice routine park image - nice color, great shadows, excellent color balance.</td>', 'A very nice routine park image - nice color, great shadows, excellent color balance.', '2016-09-11 18:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473709, 1186618, 101256, '<td valign="top">Great action capture and B&amp;W conversion. Excellent tonal balance, light/shadow perfect and the impression of depth is very effective.  Top five image.</td>', 'Great action capture and B&W conversion. Excellent tonal balance, light/shadow perfect and the impression of depth is very effective.  Top five image.', '2016-09-11 18:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473711, 1186986, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love candid imagery and the B&amp;W conversion. More than routine, this image shows the personalities of the subject perfectly. Crisp, clear - can''t say enough positive comments about this - if this isn''t in the top three, somebody got robbed.</td>', 'Love candid imagery and the B&W conversion. More than routine, this image shows the personalities of the subject perfectly. Crisp, clear - can''t say enough positive comments about this - if this isn''t in the top three, somebody got robbed.', '2016-09-11 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473712, 1187158, 101256, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my time in Vietnam where these kinds of street vendors were all over Saigon and Bien Hoa. Great capture, great color - well done.</td>', 'Reminds me of my time in Vietnam where these kinds of street vendors were all over Saigon and Bien Hoa. Great capture, great color - well done.', '2016-09-11 18:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473714, 1186268, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I think it could have used a little less exposure to bring out more detail - the shadow/light is very stark which, upon initial impression, is somewhat negative, but on a second viewing, the little exposure flaw isn''t a major issue. Clarity is excellent and the overall concept and impression are wonderful.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I think it could have used a little less exposure to bring out more detail - the shadow/light is very stark which, upon initial impression, is somewhat negative, but on a second viewing, the little exposure flaw isn''t a major issue. Clarity is excellent and the overall concept and impression are wonderful.', '2016-09-11 18:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473715, 1186886, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail, the exposure seems perfect and overall the impression is good.</td>', 'I really like the detail, the exposure seems perfect and overall the impression is good.', '2016-09-11 18:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473716, 1187179, 101256, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many will get this? :)  Nice concept and great capture. Well done and I like the joke.</td>', 'I wonder how many will get this? :)  Nice concept and great capture. Well done and I like the joke.', '2016-09-11 18:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473718, 1186738, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is a total "inside gaming" concept which I''m not sure was intentional. Exposure is too dark, but hey, it works in terms of the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, this is a total "inside gaming" concept which I''m not sure was intentional. Exposure is too dark, but hey, it works in terms of the challenge.', '2016-09-11 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473731, 1186494, 181135, '<td valign="top">Un buen mensaje de amor, no hace falta mostrarlo de cuerpo entero, esta todo dicho. Molesta un poco un cartel del lado derecho.</td>', 'Un buen mensaje de amor, no hace falta mostrarlo de cuerpo entero, esta todo dicho. Molesta un poco un cartel del lado derecho.', '2016-09-11 18:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473733, 1186796, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture - better than snapshot quality, good conversion - overall positive impression.</td>', 'Very nice capture - better than snapshot quality, good conversion - overall positive impression.', '2016-09-11 19:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473734, 1187200, 101256, '<td valign="top">Accidental exposures often produce gems.  I really like the image - fits the title perfectly.  Nice detail and color and the foreground bokeh does the trick.</td>', 'Accidental exposures often produce gems.  I really like the image - fits the title perfectly.  Nice detail and color and the foreground bokeh does the trick.', '2016-09-11 19:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
