(7473736, 1186392, 101256, '<td valign="top">Certainly is different, although I''m not familiar with the whole idea here - I''m sure I''m missing something. It can''t just be about the birds. Anyway, nice color, good detail - nice capture.</td>', 'Certainly is different, although I''m not familiar with the whole idea here - I''m sure I''m missing something. It can''t just be about the birds. Anyway, nice color, good detail - nice capture.', '2016-09-11 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
